#: kdeui/dialogs/kbugreport.cpp:433
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<p>You chose the severity <b>Critical</b>. Please note that this severity "
#| "is intended only for bugs that</p><ul><li>break unrelated software on the "
